_hires_concluding_sentence", "label": "Concluding Sentence (CS) - blue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2023-2024JSWP-Expository-GuideFNL5-hires.pdf", "source_location": "p.23 'Concluding Sentence, Blue Pen, Connect and Reflect'; p.141 CS trigger words Predict/Connect/Infer/Clarify/Evaluate", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_2023_2024jswp_expository_guidefnl5_hires_generate_commentary_four_questions", "label": "Four Questions to Generate Commentary", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2023-2024JSWP-Expository-GuideFNL5-hires.pdf", "source_location": "p.22 'Why this CD? What is significant? What am I trying to prove (not repeat TS)? How does it connect to TS/thesis/prompt?'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_2023_2024jswp_expository_guidefnl5_hires_chunk", "label": "The Chunk (smallest unit of meaning; >=3 sentences between TS and CS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2023-2024JSWP-Expository-GuideFNL5-hires.pdf", "source_location": "p.34 'A chunk is at least three sentences... made up of CDs or a combination of CDs and CM'; p.19 'A Chunk Ratio CD:CM'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_2023_2024jswp_expository_guidefnl5_hires_ratio_2plus1", "label": "Expository Ratio 2+:1 (CD:CM, most widely used)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2023-2024JSWP-Expository-GuideFNL5-hires.pdf", "source_location": "p.34 '2+:1 most widely used'; p.24 '2+:1 narrative, expository, synthesis, argument'; first number=CD, second=CM, do not change", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_2023_2024jswp_expository_guidefnl5_hires_ratio_3plus0", "label": "Summary Ratio 3+:0 (popular summary response, no commentary)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/2023-2024JSWP-Expository-GuideFNL5-hires.pdf", "source_locat